/-!
# Checked conjugacy coverage of the five displacement fibers

Every coordinate either is one of sixteen literal words or is the inverse
conjugate of a coordinate of smaller depth. Bounded word collection checks
each actual group equation. Induction transports the representative ranks
to every element of all five subgroups; no orbit discovery assertion is used
as a theorem. The representative ranks are supplied by RepresentativeRanks.

Source context: Aschbacher–Smith A.3.12, pp.47–48; Kleidman–Wilson (1988),
pp.484–510. Witnesses are generated from the adjacent untrusted orbit data.
-/

